Hm is there any reason you can't use the openai compatible one? I think a patch needs to be made to this ollama provider to work for your usecase if this is breaking^

@chetverovod add this to your opencode.json:
 ```
{
  "provider": {
    "zai-coding-plan": {
      "options": {
        "timeout": 600000
      }
    }
  }
}
```
This will override default timeout for the provider and set it to 10 minutes (timeout is in milliseconds)

